      "worked_solution": "We take each term of the first binomial and multiply it by the second binomial. Then, we simplify by collecting like terms.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(5w+2)(3w-5) & = \\\\ 5w(3w-5)+2(3w-5) & = \\\\ 15{w}^{2}-25w+6w-10 & = \\\\ 15{w}^{2}-19w-10\\end{aligned}\n$$",
